message: If you use this dataset or pipeline, please cite it.
title: "Galen Corpus Terminology Density Map"
type: dataset
version: "3.1.3"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21561962"
authors:
  - family-names: Pepperman
    given-names: William
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Montblanctech/Galen"
abstract: >
  Galen Corpus Infrastructure. A digital-availability census of the Galenic
  Greek corpus in First1KGreek (103 editions / 97 works) and a terminology
  density map; the LSJ-Gold and LS-Gold lemmatizer benchmarks and the
  LSJ-Gold lexicon; and Galen First Drafts: machine first-draft English
  translations of thirteen works of Galen with no complete English
  translation known to us (244,007 words of Greek), each with two independent
  renderings, the Greek, and pre-registered machine checks, plus a catalogue
  of 678 items found in the drafts with an attestation check against
  Fichtner's Corpus Galenicum and the fragment collections. The drafts are
  unverified. Data products are CC-BY-4.0 (the drafts and Greek-derived
  files CC-BY-SA-4.0, following First1KGreek); the pipeline code is MIT.
keywords:
  - Galen First Drafts
  - machine translation
  - history of medicine
  - Galen
  - Ancient Greek
  - terminology
  - digital humanities
  - corpus linguistics
